{"id":"393515cdafde1b06","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc.md","title":"ZFC","display":"df-zfc — ZFC","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc","aliases":["58-df-zfc","ZFC"],"display":"df-zfc — ZFC","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc</span><span>ZFC</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc — ZFC"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\\)</span> is the Zermelo--Fraenkel axiom set</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AC}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{AC}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\\)</span> is the axiom-of-choice sentence</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\\)</span> is the theory defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZFC}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZFC}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This file is an exact definitional alias of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a>.  Equivalences between AC, Zorn's lemma, and the well-ordering theorem are theorems and are not clauses of the definition.</li>\n<li>ZFC consists of the usual ZF axioms, including the Separation and Replacement schemas, together with the Axiom of Choice; it is not “nine axiom schemas.”</li>\n<li>Axioms: extensionality, null set, pairing, union, power set, infinity, foundation, replacement, separation</li>\n<li>AC: equivalent to Zorn's lemma, well-ordering theorem, cardinal comparability, Tychonoff</li>\n<li>G&quot;odel: ZFC cannot prove its own consistency (second incompleteness)</li>\n<li>Gödel's constructible universe gives a relative-consistency model of CH, while Cohen forcing gives a relative-consistency model of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Large cardinals: axioms extending ZFC; consistency strength hierarchy</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Kunen, The Foundations of Mathematics</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})$ is the theory defined in [[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This file is an exact definitional alias of [[58-ax-zfc]].  Equivalences between AC, Zorn's lemma, and the well-ordering theorem are theorems and are not clauses of the definition.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZF}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AC}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZFC}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{CH}","display":false}],"bytes":1531,"backlinks":[{"id":"35ea5f205fd10ba8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8f12f393ab28c4e4","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}$ 为 [[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]] 的公理码集合；语法、一致性及加公理运算使用 [[58-df-theory-consistency-code.md]]。"},{"id":"da331f774e716a0a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}$ 为 [[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]] 的公理码集合；语法、一致性及加公理运算使用 [[58-df-theory-consistency-code.md]]。"},{"id":"1689492fab8da0e1","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ZFC}$ 取 [[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"a2335a033d2b39a0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baa9f2ada6bcef62","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5a435dbfefa9e0ed","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})$（ZFC 公理集，见 [[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]）"},{"id":"d05bde9d5231d251","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZFC}$ 是 ZFC 公理集（见 [[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3872","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md|58-df-zfc]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}